Several `--append` flags naming the same key all land, in order: each value is appended once,
not only the last one (the pairs are kept as a list, not folded into a dict by key).

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
sessions:
- abc-123
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append sessions=def-456 --append sessions=ghi-789
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -2,5 +2,7 @@
 title: Foo
 sessions:
 - abc-123
+- def-456
+- ghi-789
 ---
 # Body
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: sessions+=def-456, sessions+=ghi-789
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
sessions:
- abc-123
- def-456
- ghi-789
---
# Body
